"The healing hospital in F City is Anesidora's main hospital, with doctors, Healers and wizards."
"Avowed reach it by emergency teleport, using the island's shared teleport allotment."
"Arrivals land in a teleport bay about a third of a dorm bedroom's size, with a triage screen."
"Staff wear jade green scrubs and give medicine through injectors pressed to the arm."
"A-rank patients arriving by teleport are asked questions about their state of mind."
"A Morph Brute girl whose brothers set her bed on fire spent weeks healing there."
"Søren, a Light Shaper, had new skin grown there after burning himself in practice."
